We need to avoid duplication with existing test cases. Existing tests cover normal concatenation, empty strings, null currentPath (but token non-null). They didn't test null token, null pathType, both null, or token with invalid characters causing exception. Also test when currentPath is null and token null.

Thus we need to create new test groups for exception scenarios.

